  title: Resources
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: "There are five types of resources that can be collected during exploration.\n\r\n<indent=1em>\u2022
    Mineral resources:</indent>\r\n<indent=2em>- <color=#D0D0D0>White Ore</color></indent>\r\n<indent=2em>-
    <color=#C86BFF>Purple Essence</color></indent>\r\n<indent=2em>- <color=#999999>Black
    Ore</color></indent>\r\n<indent=1em>\u2022 Material resources:</indent>\r\n<indent=2em>-
    <color=#D8B56A>Gear</color></indent>\r\n<indent=2em>- <color=#B0B0B0>Screw</color></indent>\n\r\nResources
    are used for upgrades and repairing the ship.\r\nYou can also research resources
    through upgrades to increase their yield during exploration."
